    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "talking to him doesn't change the math. he's tired. he's always tired. i'm just a sinkhole for his time and money and energy. i look at him and i just feel this massive guilt, like i'm stealing his life from him. it feels less like a \"communication issue\" and more like i'm just an anchor dragging him down. wouldn't it be more loving to just let him go?",
